### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

###

### 2. API Information
GET http://localhost:5000/

###

### 3. Get All Venues
GET http://localhost:5000/api/venues

###

### 4. Get Venues in New York
GET http://localhost:5000/api/venues?city=New York

###

### 5. Get All Events
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events

###

### 6. Register a New User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "myemail@example.com",
  "password": "mypassword123",
  "name": "My Name",
  "role": "user",
  "phone": "+1-555-8888"
}

###

### Login as Admin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@eventplatform.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 8. Login as Venue Owner
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@venues.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 9. Login as Customer
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mike@customer.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 10. Get Specific Venue (replace ID with real venue ID from step 3)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/venues/PASTE_VENUE_ID_HERE

###

### 11. Create New Venue (Requires Token - Login first as venue owner)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2OThlYzFiMzdhYzM3MTEyNTlmMmU1NGYiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzA5Njc1MDcsImV4cCI6MTc3MTU3MjMwN30.LjWzq9Tmf-ifqV3kMOjGubvQOxQysfdCWPz4ElZYg3c

{
  "name": "My Amazing Venue",
  "description": "A beautiful space for events and gatherings",
  "location": {
    "address": "789 Event Street",
    "city": "Chicago",
    "state": "IL",
    "zipCode": "60601"
  },
  "capacity": 150,
  "pricePerHour": 300,
  "amenities": ["WiFi", "Parking", "Catering", "AV Equipment"],
  "venueType": "party"
}

###

### 12. Create Event (Requires Token and Venue ID)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2OThlYzFiMzdhYzM3MTEyNTlmMmU1NGYiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzA5NjQyODUsImV4cCI6MTc3MTU2OTA4NX0.7BxHj-8B0c7vBI42t0Svz7Ev-XrsXKv8Kp7PArQnim0

{
  "title": "My Birthday Party",
  "description": "Celebrating my birthday with friends and family",
  "venue": "PASTE_VENUE_ID_HERE",
  "eventType": "party",
  "startDate": "2026-03-15T18:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-03-15T23:00:00Z",
  "expectedAttendees": 50,
  "ticketPrice": 0,
  "isPublic": false
}

###

### 13. Create Booking (Requires Token and Venue ID)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2OThlYzFiMzdhYzM3MTEyNTlmMmU1NGYiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzA5NjQyODUsImV4cCI6MTc3MTU2OTA4NX0.7BxHj-8B0c7vBI42t0Svz7Ev-XrsXKv8Kp7PArQnim0

{
  "venue": "PASTE_VENUE_ID_HERE",
  "startDate": "2026-04-20T14:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-04-20T18:00:00Z",
  "guests": 30,
  "specialRequests": "Please arrange vegetarian catering options"
}

###

### 14. Get My Bookings
GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2OThlYzFiMzdhYzM3MTEyNTlmMmU1NGYiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzA5NjQyODUsImV4cCI6MTc3MTU2OTA4NX0.7BxHj-8B0c7vBI42t0Svz7Ev-XrsXKv8Kp7PArQnim0